@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### 1) Instagram (slug fixo)
POST {{base}}/links
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "promo-insta-01",
  "targetUrl": "https://example.com/promo",
  "utm": { "source": "instagram", "medium": "bio", "campaign": "lancamento" }
}

### 2) WhatsApp (slug fixo)
POST {{base}}/links
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "vip-whats-01",
  "targetUrl": "https://example.com/cupons",
  "utm": { "source": "whatsapp", "medium": "broadcast", "campaign": "cupom-10", "content": "cta-botao" }
}

### 3) Newsletter (slug fixo)
POST {{base}}/links
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "newsletter-nov",
  "targetUrl": "https://example.com/blog/novidades",
  "utm": { "source": "newsletter", "medium": "email", "campaign": "novembro-2025", "term": "blackfriday", "content": "hero-banner" }
}

### 4) TikTok Ads (slug fixo)
POST {{base}}/links
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "ads-tiktok-01",
  "targetUrl": "https://example.com/curso-node",
  "utm": { "source": "tiktok", "medium": "cpc", "campaign": "video-1", "term": "curso-node" }
}

### 5) QR Code/Offline (sem anexar UTM no destino)
POST {{base}}/links
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "qr-loja-01",
  "targetUrl": "https://example.com/landing-offline",
  "utm": { "source": "print", "medium": "offline", "campaign": "folheto-loja" },
  "appendUtm": false
}

### 6) Slug automático (deixa a API gerar)
POST {{base}}/links
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUrl": "https://example.com/teaser",
  "utm": { "source": "instagram", "medium": "stories", "campaign": "stories-teaser" }
}

### Listar seus links (do usuário atual)
GET {{base}}/links?limit=50

